 n \nand distribution systems.  See 65-407 C.M.R. ch. 324\, §§ 1-18.  The
  IA was for \nBerwick Solar’s photovoltaic generation facility.  It esti
 mated total \ninterconnection costs of $65\,522 plus SCADA2 costs.  Those 
 amounts were \nbased on a fea\nhttps://www.courts.maine.gov/courts/sjc/law
 court/2026/26me098.pdf
